              "stage": "deterministic_svg"
            },
            "value": {
              "html": "<p>Ис­поль­зуя свой­ства ло­га­риф­мов, пре­об­ра­зу­ем не­ра­вен­ство:</p><center><p><span> <span data-inline-latex=\"\\frac{(x^{2}+x)\\lg (x^{2}+2x-2)}{\\left|x-1\\right|}\\ge \\frac{\\lg (-x^{2}-2x+2)^{2}}{x-1}\\iff \\frac{(x^{2}+x)\\lg (x^{2}+2x-2)}{\\left|x-1\\right|}\\ge \\frac{2\\lg (x^{2}+2x-2)}{x-1}\"></span> . </span></p></center><p>При <nobr><span data-inline-latex=\"x\\gt 1\"></span>:</nobr></p><center><p><span> <span data-inline-latex=\"\\begin{cases}\\frac{(x^{2}+x-2)\\lg (x^{2}+2x-2)}{x-1}\\ge 0\\\\x\\gt 1\\end{cases}\\iff \\begin{cases}\\frac{(x-1)(x+2)\\lg (x^{2}+2x-2)}{x-1}\\ge 0\\\\x\\gt 1\\end{cases}\\iff \\begin{cases}\\lg (x^{2}+2x-2)\\ge 0\\\\x\\gt 1\\end{cases}\\iff \\begin{cases}x^{2}+2x-2\\ge 1\\\\x\\gt 1\\end{cases}\\iff \\begin{cases}(x-1)(x+3)\\ge 0\\\\x\\gt 1\\end{cases}\\iff x\\gt 1\"></span>.</span></p><p></p></center><p>При <nobr><span data-inline-latex=\"x\\lt 1\"></span>:</nobr></p><center><p><span> <span data-inline-latex=\"\\begin{cases}\\frac{(x^{2}+x+2)\\lg (x^{2}+2x-2)}{1-x}\\ge 0\\\\x\\lt 1\\end{cases}\\iff \\begin{cases}\\frac{\\lg (x^{2}+2x-2)}{1-x}\\ge 0\\\\x\\lt 1\\end{cases}\\iff \\begin{cases}\\lg (x^{2}+2x-2)\\ge 0\\\\x\\lt 1\\end{cases}\\iff \\begin{cases}x^{2}+2x-2\\ge 1\\\\x\\lt 1\\end{cases}\\iff \\begin{cases}x^{2}+2x-3\\ge 0\\\\x\\lt 1\\end{cases}\\iff \\begin{cases}(x-1)(x+3)\\ge 0\\\\x\\lt 1\\end{cases}\\iff x\\le -3\"></span>.</span></p><p><span></span></p></center><p>Таким об­ра­зом, по­лу­ча­ем, что ре­ше­ние не­ра­вен­ства  — мно­же­ство  <span data-inline-latex=\"(-\\infty;-3]\\cup (1;+\\infty)\"></span> .</p>",
