            "html": "<p>Ис­поль­зуя свой­ства ло­га­риф­мов, пре­об­ра­зу­ем не­ра­вен­ство:</p><center><p><span> <span data-inline-latex=\"\\frac{(x^{2}+x)\\log_8 (x^{2}+4x-4)}{\\left|x-2\\right|}\\ge \\frac{\\log_8 (-x^{2}-4x+4)^{6}}{x-2}\\iff \\frac{(x^{2}+x)\\log_8 (x^{2}+4x-4)}{\\left|x-2\\right|}\\ge \\frac{6\\log_8 (x^{2}+4x-4)}{x-2}\"></span> . </span></p></center><p>При <span data-inline-latex=\"x\\gt 2\"></span>:</p><center><p><span> <span data-inline-latex=\"\\begin{cases}\\frac{(x^{2}+x-6)\\log_8 (x^{2}+4x-4)}{x-2}\\ge 0\\\\x\\gt 2\\end{cases}\\iff \\begin{cases}\\frac{(x-2)(x+3)\\log_8 (x^{2}+4x-4)}{x-2}\\ge 0\\\\x\\gt 2\\end{cases}\\iff \\begin{cases}\\log_8 (x^{2}+4x-4)\\ge 0\\\\x\\gt 2\\end{cases}\\iff \\begin{cases}x^{2}+4x-4\\ge 1\\\\x\\gt 2\\end{cases}\\iff \\begin{cases}(x-1)(x+5)\\ge 0\\\\x\\gt 2\\end{cases}\\iff x\\gt 2\"></span>.</span></p><p></p></center><p>При <span data-inline-latex=\"x\\lt 2\"></span>:</p><center><p><span> <span data-inline-latex=\"\\begin{cases}\\frac{(x^{2}+x+6)\\log_8 (x^{2}+4x-4)}{2-x}\\ge 0\\\\x\\lt 2\\end{cases}\\iff \\begin{cases}\\frac{\\log_8 (x^{2}+4x-4)}{2-x}\\ge 0\\\\x\\lt 2\\end{cases}\\iff \\begin{cases}\\log_8 (x^{2}+4x-4)\\ge 0\\\\x\\lt 2\\end{cases}\\iff\"></span> <br/> <span data-inline-latex=\"\\iff \\begin{cases}x^{2}+4x-4\\ge 1\\\\x\\lt 2\\end{cases}\\iff \\begin{cases}x^{2}+4x-5\\ge 0\\\\x\\lt 2\\end{cases}\\iff \\begin{cases}(x-1)(x+5)\\ge 0\\\\x\\lt 2\\end{cases}\\iff \\left[\\begin{aligned}x\\le -5\\\\1\\le x\\lt 2\\end{aligned}\\right.\"></span> .</span></p><p><span></span></p></center><p>Таким об­ра­зом, по­лу­ча­ем, что ре­ше­ние не­ра­вен­ства  — мно­же­ство  <span data-inline-latex=\"(-\\infty;-5]\\cup [1;2)\\cup (2;+\\infty)\"></span> .</p>",
            "title": "Решение",
